  "summary": "Price moves in waves: bullish and bearish momentums. Analysis is done on the monthly or weekly chart for direction, but entries are taken on lower-timeframe zones nested inside the HTF zone. That nested entry area is the 'location area', which keeps the stop small. A good trader enters only where momentum and location come together.",
