     "Example: price is rising from a weekly demand; on H4 that is bullish momentum. When H4 crosses its trendline, the bullish momentum is finished and a bearish one starts. On the HTF this is just price retesting the fresh demand it created.",
     "He also defines momentum as: price created a zone, then came back to it."
